  "readme": "This is a placeholder dashboard. Import the full dashboard from Grafana.com:\n\n1. Go to Dashboards > Import\n2. Enter dashboard ID: 1860\n3. Select Prometheus data source\n4. Click Import\n\nThis dashboard monitors:\n- Server 60 (192.168.1.60): backup - Monitoring hub\n- Server 61 (192.168.1.61): okamih - Production e-commerce\n- Server 62 (192.168.1.62): cpall - Web hosting\n\nMetrics include:\n- CPU usage and load\n- Memory and swap usage\n- Disk I/O and space\n- Network traffic\n- System uptime"
